  - id: FK_P02_05_N2
    speaker: "Ruby Walker"
    line: "Three years ago she rang me at four in the morning. I drove over. Neither of us ever said what it was, not that night and not after. Anyway."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    emotion: 2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: 
    nextId: FK_P02_05_N3
    choices: []
  - id: FK_P02_05_N3
    speaker: "Ally Quinn"
    line: "I don't know what it was. Ruby didn't say, and I'm not going to guess."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 792b5f88f6dd2724d84b6954cc0b5fad, type: 3}
